  "processing": "tools/bake_pets.gd: original mesh, skin and skeleton kept; the few clips listed are copied from the shared KayKit animation libraries (same bone names, tracks re-rooted onto the model skeleton), renamed to gameplay aliases and exported as one GLB per model. Godot extracts each GLB's palette texture on import (*_0.png next to it). The game draws the pets at 1.3-1.75 m and relies on Godot's automatic LODs for distance; no further decimation."
